{"turn_id": "d01-t1", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "real_world_comparison_method", "text": "作者将代词性别翻译统计数据与美国劳工统计局（U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics）关于各职业中女性参与频率的数据进行对比。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation_found", "text": "作者比较了女性工作者的分布与女性翻译的频率，发现这两个变量之间没有相关性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "gt_fails_reflect_distribution", "text": "作者指出，Google Translate 的输出未能反映女性工作者的真实世界分布，低估了预期频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "bls_quantile_distribution", "text": "作者使用美国劳工统计局数据计算每个12分位数中女性参与的频率，并与翻译出的女性代词频率对比；结果显示女性代词集中在前12分位数，而劳工统计局数据显示女性参与在第四个12分位数达到峰值。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "gender_neutral_languages_used", "text": "研究使用12种性别中立语言（如匈牙利语、中文、约鲁巴语及其他几种语言）构建句子，并翻译成英语。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d01-t2", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_data_source", "text": "作者从美国劳工统计局（Bureau of Labor Statistics）的详细职业表获取职业列表及各职业女性参与比例数据，并对超过5万从业者的职业提供女性参与百分比；他们还按职业类别整理了这些职业。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-c49993752c0b10ccfb6bdc75"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "comparison_method", "text": "为了检验男性默认是否只反映某些职业本身男女比例失衡，作者将女性工作者的分布与译文中女性代词出现的频率进行了比较。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "quantile_histograms", "text": "作者针对每个12-分位（12-quantile）计算女性参与频率，并对翻译出的女性代词频率做同样计算，然后把两组直方图并排绘制（Figure 29）进行比较。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "inverse_distribution", "text": "结果显示翻译出的女性代词分布与真实分布呈相反方向：女性代词集中在第一个12-分位；而BLS数据显示女性参与比例在第四个12-分位达到峰值，并在随后几个分位仍保持显著。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation", "text": "作者报告女性工作者分布与女性翻译频率之间没有相关性，即Google Translate的输出未能反映女性工作者的真实世界分布，并低估了预期频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "greater_than_demographics", "text": "作者指出，即便不期望翻译代词性别呈50:50分布，Google Translate出现男性默认的频率仍高于仅凭职业数据所能解释的程度。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "t_test_result", "text": "作者进行单侧t检验，原假设为女性参与频率不显著高于同一职业下Google Translate的女性代词频率；所得p值远低于其置信水平，因此拒绝原假设，结论是Google Translate的女性翻译频率低估了美国职业中女性的参与频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-524c4c9c6f083273886d5971"}]}, {"key": "averages_variance", "text": "按职业和语言平均，译文使用女性代词的比例（INLINEFORM0）低于BLS报告中所有职业女性工作者性别参与频率的平均值（INLINEFORM1），且翻译结果的方差也更低（INLINEFORM2 对比 INLINEFORM3）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-524c4c9c6f083273886d5971"}]}, {"key": "no_justification", "text": "因此作者认为不能把这种不对称理解为职场人口结构的反映，Google Translate中男性默认的突出程度缺乏明确解释。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-524c4c9c6f083273886d5971"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "experiment_date", "text": "所有报告实验均于2018年4月进行，作者并指出由于Google Translate算法可能变化，无法保证结果完全可复现。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-c49993752c0b10ccfb6bdc75"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
